Hi,

You can now restrict Google sign-ins for <%= @notice.name %> to verified Workspace
domains.

To enable this security improvement, go to Settings -> Authentication:
<%= @settings_url %>

Edit your Google provider and click Verify Now using a Workspace administrator
account. Review the domains and save.

If your users belong to multiple Workspace organizations, use Verify another
domain to include each organization before saving.

This is optional. Your existing sign-in setup keeps working unchanged.

Questions? Reply to this email.
